{"task": "WH_8134", "job": "WH_8134|LOG|0", "arm": "LOG", "attempt": 1, "role": "основной", "outcome": "годный", "reason": "годный", "final": "годный", "waits": 0, "retries": 0, "streak": 0, "flags": {"api_retry_до_начала": 0, "api_retry_после_начала": 0, "оборванный_ход": false, "message_start": 1}, "started": "2026-10-29T08:05:58+00:00", "finished": "2026-10-29T08:06:30+00:00", "config_sha256": "32007d9801ef6a1d30df54bee62739f385c4ebb8f7898c350e27e85b814bcfa1", "binary_sha256": "27122ca7b624f537546fbef35b80c66370d974ff258f3d9b10ac50bb8771f262", "cli_init_version": "2.1.294", "cli_pinned_version": "2.1.294", "model_target": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_usage_keys": ["claude-opus-5-5"], "model_usage_out": {"claude-opus-5-5": 2560}, "init_sha256": "19a6ffcf0781096cd8fadcc901d1f698c81748761870f4f438dc6f07a56b3d9a", "session_id": "ece98e7a-0ba0-49fa-9720-291fc75a25ac", "effort": "medium", "thinking_budget": "31999", "thinking_tokens": 1594, "env_config": {"API_TIMEOUT_MS": "1200000", "CLAUDE_BYTE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_GIT_INSTRUCTIONS": "1", "CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_NONESSENTIAL_TRAFFIC": "1", "CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES": "0", "CLAUDE_ENABLE_BYTE_WATCHDOG": "1", "CLAUDE_ENABLE_STREAM_WATCHDOG": "1", "CLAUDE_STREAM_FIRST_BYTE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "CLAUDE_STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_MS": "180000", "DISABLE_AUTOUPDATER": "1", "DISABLE_GROWTHBOOK": "1", "MAX_THINKING_TOKENS": "31999"}, "env_access_names": ["ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL", "CLAUDE_CODE_PROXY_RESOLVES_HOSTS", "CLAUDE_SESSION_INGRESS_TOKEN_FILE", "CURL_CA_BUNDLE", "HTTPS_PROXY", "NODE_EXTRA_CA_CERTS", "NO_PROXY", "PATH", "REQUESTS_CA_BUNDLE", "SSL_CERT_FILE", "https_proxy", "no_proxy"], "usage": {"inp": 5950, "out": 2560, "cost_usd": 0.0918812}, "answer": {"p": [0.55, 0.4, 0.5, 0.15, 0.8, 0.35, 0.25, 0.8]}, "exit": {"returncode": 0, "timed_out": false, "stderr_bytes": 0, "stderr_sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855", "spawn_error": null}, "stream": {"file": "WH_8134_LOG_0-d209bc2e.a001.osn.jsonl.gz", "sha256": "1489c5e8eee5b8c17995e39636133ca9a73de41ad0f0a4d5729e24a97645482c", "bytes": 75176, "lines": 225, "events_no_deltas": [{"type": "system", "subtype": "init", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "tools": ["StructuredOutput"], "mcp_servers": [], "permissionMode": "auto", "claude_code_version": "2.1.294", "output_style": "default", "init_sha256": "19a6ffcf0781096cd8fadcc901d1f698c81748761870f4f438dc6f07a56b3d9a"}, {"type": "system", "subtype": "status", "status": "requesting"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "message_start", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWBbG6RKUniqfB7rJRpC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5062, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5062}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "ttft_ms": 1564, "thinking_display": "updates"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 0, "content_block": {"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": ""}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "thinking_display": "updates"}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWBbG6RKUniqfB7rJRpC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "", "signature": {"длина": 5216, "sha256": "5cec1e67137ece87dfb7f966a93a65eef679a10c19e94fabccee58750d6b49d7"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5062, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5062}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:06:20.283Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWBbFfNQ1Z2TC1hZkXKb", "thinking_duration_ms": 19075}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 0}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 1, "content_block": {"type": "text", "text": ""}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWBbG6RKUniqfB7rJRpC", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "I ranked the plans by reasoning through them and running rough numbers in my head, not by simulating them step by step. So these probabilities are judgement calls, not exact results.\n\n**Key costs.**\n- Each unit has a margin of 3 (selling price 13 minus purchase price 10). A unit of demand left unmet loses that 3 plus a 3 penalty, so a shortfall costs about 6.\n- Stock lasts 4 days. With orders every 2 days, leftover stock mostly carries into the next cycle. Overstocking then costs mainly storage (0.6 or 0.4 a day) and only sometimes a write-off at 10.\n- Running slightly above forecast is therefore better, especially since the demand multiplier averages 1.046.\n- No plan seems to hit the 168-unit warehouse limit: the two products arrive on different days because their lead times differ.\n\n**The 2-day plans (0, 4, 6, 7)** differ only in how much they order. Each order covers two days of forecast demand, and I compared it to that demand. For example, the day-0 order covers days 2–3 of product 0: 26 + 20 = 46.\n- **Plan 4:** about 1.15× forecast. Best cover against shortfalls, with mostly cheap overstock.\n- **Plan 7:** about 1.10×. Close behind 4.\n- **Plan 0:** about 1.046×, i.e. exactly the average demand. More shortfalls.\n- **Plan 6:** about 0.9×. Short on most days.\n\n**The other plans:**\n- **Plan 2:** product 0 is like plan 7, but product 1 is ordered every 3 days on different days. That makes 18 ordering days instead of 13, roughly 140 more in fees, and it holds more stock. Probably a little worse than 7.\n- **Plan 1:** orders every 3 days at about 1.0× forecast, below average demand. It saves about 112 in fees but has more shortfalls and storage costs.\n- **Plan 5:** orders daily at about 1.05× forecast. It pays roughly 364 more in fees and has almost no buffer stock carried between days. The storage it saves doesn't seem to cover that.\n- **Plan 3:** orders every 4 days at about 1.0× forecast. It holds the most stock, and since stock lasts exactly 4 days, any leftover at the end of a cycle is written off. Likely the worst.\n\n**Estimated ranking:** 4 ≈ 7 > 0 > 2 > 1 > 5 > 6 > 3. The middle (plans 0, 2, 1, 5) is the least certain, so those probabilities stay closer to 0.5."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 5062, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 5062}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:06:29.729Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWBbFfNQ1Z2TC1hZkXKb"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01NyAJdBDDoQfN8i4px8UdUX", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id"